    "id": "around-the-world-in-eighty-days-world",
    "name": "Around the World in Eighty Days",
    "description": "Phileas Fogg wagers that the new railways and steamship lines can carry him around the globe in eighty days. Travelling east with Passepartout, pursued by a mistaken detective, and joined by Aouda, he discovers that precision can master a timetable but not the loyalty, danger, and affection encountered along the route.",
